  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndị ozi ọgbụgba ndụ ọhụrụ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị na-ebido ito onwe anyị ọzọ? Ọ dị a mkpa anyị inye unu, maọbụ ịnata nʼaka unu akwụkwọ nkọwa iji too onwe anyị dịka ụfọdụ mmadụ ndị ọzọ si eme?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu onwe unu bụ akwụkwọ ozi anyị nke e dere nʼobi anyị nke mmadụ niile maara ma gụọkwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu na-egosikwa na unu bụ akwụkwọ ozi si nʼebe Kraịst nọ, mpụta ihe nke ozi anyị jere. Ọ bụghị ihe e ji inki",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "dee na mbadamba nkume, kama ọ bụ mmụọ Chineke na-adị ndụ ka e ji dee ya na mbadamba obi mmadụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke a bụ ntụkwasị obi anyị nwere site na Kraịst nʼebe Chineke nọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ dịkwaghị mgbe anyị ji chee nʼime onwe anyị, na anyị nwere ike ime ihe ọbụla bara uru site nʼike aka anyị, kama ihe ọbụla anyị nwere, ihe ọbụla anyị rụpụtara, sitere nʼaka Chineke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye mere ka anyị zuo oke ịbụ ndị ozi ya nke ọgbụgba ndụ ọhụrụ, nke edeghị nʼakwụkwọ iwu kama nʼime Mmụọ. Ihe e dere nʼakwụkwọ iwu na-eweta ọnwụ, ma Mmụọ na-enye ha ndụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebube nke ọgbụgba ndụ ọhụrụ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ọ bụrụ nʼije ozi ahụ nke na-eweta ọnwụ bụ nke e gbunyere nʼelu nkume ji ebube dị ukwuu bịa, nke mere na ụmụ Izrel apụghị ilegide Mosis anya nʼihu mgbe o si nʼelu ugwu Saịnaị rịdata nʼihi ebube nke ihu ya, bụ ebube nke na-agabiga agabiga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ọ bụ nʼije ozi nke Mmụọ nsọ agaghị adị ebube karịa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na-enwere ebube nʼime ije ozi nke amamikpe, ije ozi nke ezi omume ga-adị ebube karịa ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼezie, ihe jupụtara nʼebube mgbe ochie enwekwaghị ebube ọbụla ugbu a, nʼihi na ebube nke ọgbụgba ndụ ọhụrụ ekpuchiela ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na ihe na-agafe agafe nwere ebube dị otu a, ihe ga-anọgide mgbe niile ga-enwe ebube karịa ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ebe ọ bụ na anyị nwere olileanya dị otu a, anyị enweghị egwu ọbụla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị agaghị adị ka Mosis onye weere akwa kpuchie ihu ya, nʼihi na ọ chọghị ka ụmụ Izrel hụ ebube ahụ na-agbanwe agbanwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama e mechiri obi ha ruo taa. Nʼihi na mgbe ọbụla ha gụrụ akwụkwọ ọgbụgba ndụ ochie ahụ, akwa mkpuchi ahụ na-anọgidekwa apụghị apụ nʼobi ha, nʼihi na ọ bụ naanị site nʼime Kraịst ka ọ ga-eji pụọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, tutu ruo taa, mgbe ọbụla ha na-agụ akwụkwọ iwu ahụ Mosis dere, ihe mkpuchi na-adịgide nʼobi ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma mgbe onye ọbụla tụgharịrị nʼebe Onyenwe anyị nọ, a na-ewepụ akwa mkpuchi ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na Onyenwe anyị bụ Mmụọ, ma ebe ọbụla kwa Mmụọ Onyenwe anyị nọ, nʼebe ahụ ka mmadụ pụrụ inwere onwe ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị niile bụ ndị e wepụrụla akwa mkpuchi site nʼihu, na-egosi ebube nke Onyenwe anyị. A na-agbanwe anyị ịbanye nʼoyiyi ya site nʼebube ruo nʼebube, nke si nʼaka Onyenwe anyị, onye bụ Mmụọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
